      "text": [
        "Plumbing & heating, done properly",
        "From a dripping tap to a full boiler swap, our engineers carry the parts and know-how to sort it in one visit wherever possible.",
        "Boiler Installation",
        "Worcester Bosch and Vaillant accredited installers. Free no-obligation quotes and finance options available on new boilers.",
        "Boiler Repair & Servicing",
        "No heating, no hot water, or an F-code on the display? We diagnose faults fast and carry common parts on the van.",
        "Leak Detection & Repair",
        "Hidden leak under the floor or behind a wall? We use moisture meters and thermal cameras to find it before we open anything up.",
        "Bathroom Plumbing",
        "Taps, toilets, showers and full bathroom re-plumbs for renovations, handled cleanly with dust sheets and covers as standard.",
        "Central Heating",
        "Powerflushing, radiator installs, and system upgrades to fix cold spots and bring your heating bills back down.",
